            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your elemental heritage is reflected in the oils and fragrances of plants, in tree resin that fossilizes into amber, or in the gentle smell of a flower. Sticky, golden sap runs through your veins instead of blood. Each time a creature deals slashing or piercing damage to you with a melee Strike, your sap coats its weapon or unarmed attack.\n\nThe creature takes a –1 circumstance penalty on attack rolls with that weapon or unarmed attack until the end of its turn."
            }
          }
        }
